 rogram.\n\nOrganisation: Research Institute for Sustainability (RIFS) at G
 FZ\, with the City of Potsdam and the DAAD Artists-in-Berlin Program\nLoca
 tion: Potsdam\, Germany. In person. Open to artists in any field\; no nati
 onality or residence requirement stated.\nAward: Monthly stipend of EUR 2\
 ,500\, plus a lump sum for travel to Potsdam and back\, and up to EUR 5\,0
 00 housing support if you stay in Potsdam. No application fee stated.\nDur
 ation: At least 4 and ideally up to 6 months\, starting mid-2027\n\nMore: 
